  "descriptionHtml": "<p>Our Margot suede shoulder bag delivers a sleek touch to your wardrobe—its slim silhouette and convertible strap make it easy to style for dinner or daytime plans. A zip-top closure and interior zip and slip pockets keep essentials organized, and the suede adds a refined finish to the structured silhouette.</p>\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin-top: 1.5rem;\">\n<h4 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\">Specifications & Details</h4>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: none; padding-left: 0; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.6;\">\n<li><strong>Material:</strong> Suede</li>\n<li><strong>Hardware:</strong> Silver hardware</li>\n<li><strong>Lining:</strong> Lining: fabric</li>\n<li><strong>Shoulder Strap Drop:</strong> Shoulder strap with 4.75&quot; drop, adjustable and removeable crossbody strap with 22&quot; drop</li>\n<li><strong>Pockets:</strong> Interior: 1 zip pocket, 1 slip pocket</li>\n<li><strong>Closure:</strong> Zip closure</li>\n<li><strong>Bag Dimensions:</strong> 10.48&quot; (L) x 6.56&quot; (H) x 2.80&quot; (W)</li>\n</ul>\n</div>",
